<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Jakob</book>
  <para style="h">Jakob</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jakob</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakob</para>
  <para style="mt">Jakob</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob, Pathian leh Toupa Jesu Khrist sikha in, nam sawmlehnih dalhte chibai a buk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, na ginna uh ze-etna in kuhkalna a siam chih thei in, khemna chiteng na tuah chiang un kipahna ngen in sim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ginna ze-etna un kuhkalna a siam chih thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangmah tasam lou a na kim ua, na vek ua na bit theihna ding un, kuhkalna in semkim hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lak ua kuapeuh in pilna a taksap leh mi tengteng kiang a itlou leh tailou a pepa Pathian kiang ah ngen hen, huchi in a kiang ah piak a hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh ginglel hetlou in ginna nei in ngen hen, ginglelmi tuipi kihot huih mutleng leh sep bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchibang mi’n Toupa kiang ah bangmah muh kiging kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungsim det neiloumi a thilhih tengteng ah a kip kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unau daikilkal a om dopsang a a om ziak in kipak hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihau hihneu a a om ziak in kipak zaw hen; loupa pak bang a a man ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni hongsuak a huihlum a hongnun in loupa a vuai a; a pak pulh a; a kilawmna a mangthang hi; huchi mah bang in mihau a paina ah a vuai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khemna thuak teitei mi a hampha hi; ze-et a om nung in hinna lallukhu, Toupa’n amah itte kiang a a chiam a muh ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kuamah in khemna a tuahlai in Pathian khem ka hi, chi kei hen. Pathian gitlouh a khemvual ahi kei, aman leng kuamah a khem kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Michih amau utna a hip leh pimang a a om chiang un khemna a tuak uh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan utna in nou a pai a, gilou a hong pichin in sihna a suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka nau deihtakte aw, khem in omkei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thilpiak hoih leh thilpiak buching tunglam a kipan a vakte Pa kiang a kipan a hongsuk ahi a, amah ah lamdanna leh kikhekna lim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thilsiamte lak a gahmasa i hong hihtheihna ding in, amah deihlam in thutak lak a pan in a hon suangkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Unau deihtakte aw, huaite na thei uhi, himahleh michih ngaihkhiak kilawp henla, thugen kituhpih kei henla, heh hak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihing thangpaihna in Pathian diktatna a bawl kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaiziak in nin tengteng leh gilou dimval koihmang unla, thu na kha uh hondam thei, thunuailut tak in pom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh noumau kikhem in ngaikhete leltak hilou in thuzuite hizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kuapeuh thu ngaikhia a zui tuanlou zaw limlang a a pianpih maitang hoihtak a ki en bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hoihtak in a ki en a, a paimang zoh in mi bangchi ahia a hih a ki mangngilh nawnpah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh kuapeuh dan bukim, noplenna dan vel a, huchibang a om gige a, ngaikhia a, mangngilh nawn maimah nak bang hiloute zui a nasem gige mi a thilhih ah vualzawl in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kuapeuh sabiak limsak hi a kigingta a, a lei veng hoihlou a, amah lungtang kikhem zaw mi sabiak dan bangmah ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I Pathian leh Pa mitmuh a sabiak siangthou leh gilou panglou zaw, tagah leh meithaite a gimthuak lai ua veh leh khovel buahna banglou a kibawl zel ahi,.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, i Toupa Jesu Khrist, thupina Toupa gingta kawm in, mi khentuam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kikhopnain uah mi dangkaeng zungbuh bun, puan hoihtak silh honglut henla, huan mi genthei puansetak silh honglut sam leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puan hoihtak silhmi na limsak ua a kiang ah, “Nang hiai mun hoih ah tu in” na chi ua, mi genthei kiang ah bel, “Nang huai ah na ding inla, ahihkeileh, ka khe ngakna nuai ah tu in” na chih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na lungsim uah khentuam nei leh ngaihtuahna giloupu, gense mite na honghi kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka unau deihtakte aw, Pathian in hiai khovel a gentheite ginna a hau ding leh amah itte kiang a a chiam gam luah ding in a chi kei a hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nou bel migentheite na zahlaksak zaw uhi. Mihaute hilou uhia nou hon nuaisiah? Mihaute hilou uhia vaihawmna a nou hon kailut?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute hilou uhia min hoih na put uh gensete?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Laisiangthou in, “Nangmah na ki-it bang in na vengte na it ding ahi” chih kumpi dan na zop uleh na hih hoih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh mi khentuam na neih uleh, na hihkhial uhi, dan in talekte na hih uh a hon theisak zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuapeuh in dan zuikim mahleh munkhat a a hihkhelh leh, avek ah siamlouh tang in a omkhin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Angkawm ken” chipan “Tualthat ken” a chilai hi. Huchi in angkawm keimah lechin tual na thah in, dan a talekpa na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in noplenna dan a vai hawmsak dingte bang in thugen unla, thilhih behlap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi tung a chitna neilou chitna panglou in vai a hawmsak nak uhi. Vaihawmna tung a vualzou zahngaihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, min ginna ka nei chi mahleh thilhih a neihkei leh bang a phatuam dia? Huchibang ginna in amah a hondam thei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaupa hiam, unau nu hiam, vuaktang a om in a niteng annek tasam le uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na lak ua kuahiam in a kiang ah, “Khamuangtak in pai inla, lumtak leh vahtak in om in” chi in a sa ading a thil kiphamoh pe tuankei leh bang a phatuam dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in ginna leng thilhih neilou a amah kia a a om leh si ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi, mi kuahiam in “Nang ginna na nei a, ken thilhih ka nei hi;” na ginna na thilhih panglou in hon ensak inla ken thilhih in ka ginna k’on ensak ding a chithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian khat kia ahi chih na gingta maw? Na hihhoih e: dawite’n leng a gingta ua, a ling zel uhi, a chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi thulimlou aw, thilhih panglou a ginna lel bangmah ahi kei chih na thei nuam hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I pu uh Abraham in a tapa Isak maitam tung a a latlai in thilhih ziak a siamtang ahi kei a hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ginna in thilhih toh a semkhawm a, thilhih ziak in ginna a bukimta chih i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Abraham in Pathian a gingta a, huai ginna a diktatna a sim ahi” chih Laisiangthou hihkim in a om hi; huchi in amah Pathian lawm chih in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ginna ziak kia hilou in, thilhih ziak zaw in min siam a tangzel uh chih na theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchibang in, Rahab kizuaknu’n leng sawltakte a na kipahpih a lamtuam a a paisak lai in, thilhih ziak in siamtang ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kha panglou in pumpi a si hi, huchibang in thilhih panglou in ginna leng si ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, na lak uah mi tampi heutu in hong omkei un, heutu in vaihawmna thupi sem a tuak ding chih i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil tampi ah i vek un i gilou nak uhi. Kuapeuh thugen lam a a gitlouh kei leh mi piching ahi a, a pumpi vengthei mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un, Sakolte’n i thu a man theihna ding un a kam uah kamkaihna sikkual i bat leh a pumpi uh i kaihei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Longte leng ngaihtuah sam un, a lian mahmah ua, huih hat mutleng in a om nak uhi, himahleh a longhekpa’n a paisak utna lam peuh ah a hekna neuchik petmah in a kiheisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichibang in lei pumpi hiang neuchik ahi a, nakpitak in a kiuangsak nak hi. Ngai un, mei neuchik phet in sing nak katsak natel e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan lei tuh mei ahi, pumpi hiangte lak a gitlouhna lumpi, pumpi avek a ninsak a, mihing kisuansawn dan pianphungpi kangsak ahi; huai lei mah in gawtmun mei toh a peh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sa chichih, vasa chichih, ganhing chichih tuipi ate khoizual theih ahi ua, mite khoizual in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh lei zaw kuamah in a khoizual theikei uhi; sihna gu a dim gilou om kinken theilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai lei in Pa Pathian i phat ua; huai mah in Pathian bang a bawl mihingte i hamsiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kam khat a kipan in phatna leh hamsia a pawtnak hi. Ka unaute aw, huchibang ding hilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuikhuk khat in nak khat mah a kipan in tui lim leh limlou a suaksak zel a hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, theipi kung ah Olive thei a gahthei ahia? Ahihkeileh grepgui ah theipi a gah thei ahia? Huchibang in chikhuk in tui allou a suaksak thei sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lak uah kua a pil in, thu a theithei a? Thunuailut leh piltak in a thilhihte omdan hoih in ensak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh na lungtang uah hazatna thupitak leh kidemna na neih uleh thudik zuausan kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai bang pilna zaw tunglam a kipan a hong paisuk ahikei a, khovel leh pumpi utna dawi a kipan ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hazatna leh kidemna omna ah buaina leh thil hihkhelhna chiteng a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tunglam a kipan pilna bel, a tung in a siangthou phot a, huaikhit in kituah a ut a, a nunnem a, a chihnuam a, hehpihna leh gah hoih in a dim a, khentuam a neikei a, a lepchiah kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Diktatna gah kilemna bawlte’n a tuh uh lemna gah ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na lak ua kidouna leh kinaknate koi a kipan a hongsuak ahi ua? Na sapum hiangte ua kidouna bawlnak, na duhgawlna ua kipante a pawt ahi kei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lunggulh ua, na nei tuankei ua; na that ua, na eng ua, na kidou ua, gal na bawl ua, na nei tuankei uh, na ngetlouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ngen ua, na nget diklouh ziak un na mu kei uh, na nopsak bawlna ding ua zat na tup ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nou angkawm hatte aw, khovel lawm hihna Pathian melma hihna ahi chih na theikei ua hia? Huchi in kuapeuh khovel lawm hih ut Pathian melma in a kibawl nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihkeileh eimah a teng Kha in “Haza khop hial in a hondeih chih Laisiangthou in a gen bangmahlou in na ngaihtuah ua hia?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh hehpihna tamsem a penak hi. Huaiziak in Laisiangthou in, “Pathian in mi kisatheite a dou a, kingaineute hehpihna a penak” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian thuthu in om un; himahleh Diabol dou un, a hon taimangsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian naih unla, aman a honnaih ding. Khialte aw, na khut uh silsiang un: lungsim bulbal neiloute aw, na lungtang uh hihsiangthou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Haksa sa unla, lungkham unla, kapkhia un; na nuih uh kahna suak henla, na kipah uh lungkhamna suak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh in kingaineu un, huchi in a hon hihlian ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute aw, ki gensetuah kei un. Kuapeuh in a unau a gensiat hiam a vaihawm khum leh dan a gensia a vaihawm khum ahi; dan na gensiat leh dan zuimi na hi kei a, vaihawmpa na hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan pepa leh vaihawmpa, amah hondam theipa leh hihmang theipa khatlel a om hi; Nang na vengte vaihawm khum kua kisa na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tun ah noute’n ngai un, “Tuni hiam zingchiang hiam in, huai khopi ah i hawh ding ua, huai ah kum khat i va tam ding ua, i sumsin ding ua, punna i mu ding,” chite aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zingchiang a bang hongom ding ahia chih nathei kei uhi. Na hinna uh bang ahia? Mei sawtlou kal a hongdawk a, mangnawn lel bang na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in “Toupa’n pha a sakleh i dam dia, hiai hiam, huai hiam i hih ding” na chih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh na ki-otsaknate uh na suangzaw ua, huai bang suanna tengteng gilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in kuapeuh thil hoih ding thei a hih tuanlou zaw amah ading in khelhna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihausate aw, Ngai un! Na tung ua gimthuakna hongtung ding ziak in kap unla, mau tuaituai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na goute uh a seta hi, na puante uh leikha in nekhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na dangkaeng uleh na dangkate uh a tuiek khinta hi; a tuiek nou hon mawhpaihtu leh meikang bang a na sa uh kangse zou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, na lou ua buh at a kilohte loh amau khem a na piaklouh uh a kikou ua, buh atte mangbang kikou aw Mipite Toupa bil ah a lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khovel ah nuamsatak in na om ua, na kizangbei mawkmawk ua, na thahni un na lungtang uh na taisak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midiktat, nou a hondou loute siamlouh tangsak in na that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in unaute aw, Toupa hong paima teng kuhkaltak in om un. Ngai un, louneimi in vuahtui ke masa leh nanung a muh mateng leigah hoihtak a ngak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nou leng kuhkaltak in om un; na lungtang uh hihkip un; Toupa hongpaina ding a naita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unaute aw, siamlouhtang a na omlouhna ding un, ki phunkhum kei un; ngai un, vaihawmpa kongkhak bul ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unaute aw, Toupa min a thugenmi zawlneite thuakdan leh kuhkal dan uh zuih ding in nei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai un, a thuak mite tuh nuamsa i chi uhi; Job kuhkal dan na zata ua, Toupa’n a tawp a ahihdan leh Toupa hehpihna a dim dan leh zah a ngaih theih dan leng na mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh ka unaute aw, bangteng tung ah, kichiam kei un; van lou in hiam, lei lou in hiam, thil dang himhim lou in hiam kichiam kei un. “Hi” na chih uh 'hi' henla; “Hilou” na chih uh 'hilou' hi hen; huchilou in zaw siamlouh tang in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lak uah thil hoihlou thuak a om uhia? Thum uhen. Kipak a om uhia? Phatna lasa uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na lak uah damlou a om uhia? Saptuam Upa samsak uhenla, aman Toupa min a sathau nilh in a tung ah thum hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan ginna a thumna in damlou a dam ding a, Toupa’n amah a kaithou ding; thil a hihkhelh takleh ngaihdam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in hihdam a na omtheihna ding un, na khelhnate uh thupha kitawituah unla, ki thumsak tuah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Midiktat thumna in thil thupitak a hihzel hi. Elijah leng eimah piandan bang pu mihing ahi a, ama’n vuah zuklouhna ding in phatuamngaitak in a thum a, kum thum leh kha guk sungteng leitung ah vuah a zukei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thum nawn a, van in vuah a zusak a, lei in a gahte a honsuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, na lak ua mi kuapeuh thutak a kipan in pialmang henla kuahiam in pikik nawn leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mikhial a lamhaihna a kipan a kiheisak pa’n sihna a kipan a kha a hondam ding a, khelhna tampi a khuhsak lai ding chih kithei hen.
  </para>
</usx>
